  "abstract": "This submission is a direct replication of Ariadne I's current SOTA model (ID 411). It utilizes the Fourier Forecaster with ScalarRamp, increased MLP hidden size (160), adjusted dropout (0.05), and specific learning rate (9e-4). This re-replication aims to establish the absolute current top baseline for Lumina I's further research.",
